                <invention-title lang="de">KAMERA, WECHSELOBJEKTIVVORRICHTUNG, ADAPTERVORRICHTUNG, STEUERUNGSVERFAHREN UND BILDGEBUNGSSTEUERUNGSPROGRAMM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL PHOTO, APPAREIL À LENTILLE INTERCHANGEABLE, APPAREIL ADAPTATEUR, PROCÉDÉ DE COMMANDE ET PROGRAMME DE COMMANDE D'IMAGERIE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">CAMERA, INTERCHANGEABLE LENS DEVICE, ADAPTER DEVICE, CONTROL METHOD, AND IMAGING CONTROL PROGRAM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A camera (20) to which an interchangeable lens apparatus (10) is connectable via at least one adapter apparatus (30, 40) comprises a lens-camera communication controller (205, 207) configured to communicate with the interchangeable lens apparatus (10) by using a camera-lens communication channel (100) and an adapter-camera communication controller (205, 209) configured to communicate with the adapter apparatus (30, 40) by using a camera-adapter communication channel (300) provided separately from the camera-lens communication channel (100). The camera-lens communication channel (100) includes a first data communication line (DLC, DCL) used during a data communication and a first notification line (LCLK) used for a notification of a timing of a communication between the camera and the interchangeable lens apparatus, and the camera-adapter communication channel (300) consists of a second data communication line (DATA) used during the data communication and a second notification line (CS) that is used for a notification of a timing of a communication between the camera and the adapter apparatus and is provided separately from the first notification line (LCLK).</p>
            </abstract>
